        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Pay for Sick Leave is granted for a minimum of two (2) hours of absence due to illness or injury as provided in Section C of this Article. Absence in excess of two (2) hours is granted in increments of one-tenth (1/10) of an hour. Advance approval is required when Sick Leave is taken for less than four hours.",
